{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9b1e2c3d-4f5a-6b7c-8d9e-0f1a2b3c4d5e",
    "name": "Corelink Backend API (Centralized BFF & Supabase Engine)",
    "description": "# Corelink Server Centralized Backend API\n\nThis collection provides all centralized backend endpoints for the **LinkedIn AI Post Scheduler** mobile app and scheduler engine.\n\n###  Centralized Architecture (Backend-as-a-Gateway):\nInstead of the mobile app directly hitting multiple disparate services, **`corelink_server` acts as the single source of truth** for:\n1. **Authentication & Profile State**: LinkedIn OAuth code exchange, AES-256 token encryption, and Supabase user profile management.\n2. **AI Content Generation**: CoreLink AI Engine for LinkedIn posts & hook optimization.\n3. **Post & Schedule Management**: Full Supabase PostgreSQL-backed CRUD for drafts, scheduled posts, calendar views, and post stats.\n4. **Publishing Pipeline & Cron Engine**: Cloudflare Worker cron-triggered queue processing and instant publishing.\n\n###  Compatibility:\n- Fully compatible with **Postman** and **Hoppscotch** (Postman v2.1.0 schema).\n- Environment variables: `{{base_url}}`, `{{auth_token}}`, `{{cron_secret}}`, `{{post_id}}`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Authentication & User Profile",
      "description": "Endpoints managing LinkedIn OAuth login, token encryption, user profile upserts in Supabase, and session state.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 LinkedIn OAuth Callback & Token Exchange",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"auth_token\", jsonData.token);",
                  "}",
                  "if (jsonData.user && jsonData.user.id) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"user_id\", jsonData.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"{{linkedin_auth_code}}\",\n  \"redirectUri\": \"http://localhost:5000/api/auth/linkedin/callback\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/linkedin",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "linkedin"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 1.1 LinkedIn OAuth Token Exchange\n\nCalled by the mobile app after the user authorizes in the browser.\n\n**Server Execution Flow:**\n1. Exchanges `code` with LinkedIn for `access_token` and `refresh_token` using the server's private `LINKEDIN_CLIENT_SECRET`.\n2. Fetches user claims from LinkedIn OpenID `/v2/userinfo` (`sub`, `name`, `email`, `picture`).\n3. Encrypts the LinkedIn access token with **AES-256-GCM**.\n4. Upserts the user and encrypted token in Supabase `profiles` table.\n5. Generates a secure session token / JWT for the client app.\n\n**Sample Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOi...\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"782bbdua-uuid\",\n    \"name\": \"Jane Doe\",\n    \"email\": \"jane.doe@example.com\",\n    \"picture\": \"https://media.licdn.com/...\",\n    \"linkedinMemberId\": \"782bbdua\",\n    \"tokenExpiresAt\": \"2026-11-01T12:00:00.000Z\"\n  }\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 Get Current Authenticated Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}",
                "description": "Client Session JWT"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 1.2 Get Current Profile\n\nRetrieves the authenticated user's profile and LinkedIn connection status from Supabase."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 Success (Redis Cache Hit)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"source\": \"REDIS\",\n  \"profile\": {\n    \"id\": \"user_uuid_here\",\n    \"linkedin_urn\": \"urn:li:person:xyz\",\n    \"name\": \"Alex Rivera\",\n    \"email\": \"alex@example.com\",\n    \"picture_url\": \"https://media.licdn.com/...\"\n  },\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"user_uuid_here\",\n    \"name\": \"Alex Rivera\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 Success (Supabase DB Query)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"source\": \"SUPABASE\",\n  \"profile\": {\n    \"id\": \"user_uuid_here\",\n    \"linkedin_urn\": \"urn:li:person:xyz\",\n    \"name\": \"Alex Rivera\",\n    \"email\": \"alex@example.com\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 Disconnect LinkedIn Integration",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/disconnect",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "disconnect"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 1.3 Disconnect LinkedIn\n\nRevokes the LinkedIn OAuth token and clears encrypted credentials from the user's Supabase profile."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. AI Post Generation (CoreLink AI Engine)",
      "description": "Endpoints communicating with CoreLink AI Engine to generate viral hooks, formatted post drafts, and hashtag recommendations.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 Generate LinkedIn Post Draft",
          "request": {
