            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Timezone-Offset",
                "value": "180",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "Minutes offset from UTC (e.g. 180 for GMT+3)"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"topic\": \"Why serverless architectures and edge crons beat traditional VPS for early-stage MVPs\",\n  \"tone\": \"insightful\",\n  \"targetAudience\": \"Software Engineers & Startup Founders\",\n  \"includeHashtags\": true,\n  \"keyTakeaway\": \"Zero idle cost, auto-scaling, and effortless developer velocity.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/generate",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "generate"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 2.1 Generate Post Draft\n\nCalls CoreLink AI Engine with optimized system prompts designed specifically for LinkedIn algorithms:\n- Attention-grabbing opening hook (lines 1–2).\n- Double line-breaks for mobile readability.\n- Actionable takeaways.\n- Curated 3–5 professional hashtags.\n\n**Sample Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"draft\": {\n    \"hook\": \"Most startups spend $50/mo on idle VPS servers they don't even utilize.\",\n    \"content\": \"Most startups spend $50/mo on idle VPS servers they don't even utilize.\\n\\nHere is why we went 100% serverless for Corelink:\\n\\n1. Zero idle cost (Vercel + Supabase)\\n2. Global edge crons under 10ms CPU (Cloudflare Workers)\\n3. Infinite scale with zero ops overhead\\n\\nWhat is your preferred MVP stack in 2026?\\n\\n#Serverless #NodeJS #Startup #Cloud #WebDev\",\n    \"hashtags\": [\"#Serverless\", \"#NodeJS\", \"#Startup\", \"#Cloud\", \"#WebDev\"]\n  }\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 Optimize / Rewrite Opening Hook",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
