            "description": "### 3.1 Create Scheduled Post\n\nSaves a new post into Supabase `posts` table.\n\n**Payload Fields:**\n- `content` (string, required): Full text of the post.\n- `scheduledAt` (ISO8601 string, required): Desired publication timestamp.\n- `status` (string): `pending` (scheduled) or `draft`.\n- `mediaUrl` (optional string): Attached image/video URL."
