    {
      "name": "4. Publishing Pipeline & Cloudflare Cron Engine",
      "description": "Background processing endpoints handling atomic row-claiming, AES-256 token decryption, and LinkedIn REST publishing.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "4.1 Process Scheduled Queue (Cron Dispatcher)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{cron_secret}}",
                "description": "Shared secret verifying the request came from Cloudflare Worker Cron"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"batchSize\": 10\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/publish",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "publish"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 4.1 Process Scheduled Queue (Cron Trigger)\n\nTriggered every 10 minutes by the Cloudflare Worker Cron.\n\n**Server Execution Pipeline:**\n1. Verifies `CRON_SECRET` header.\n2. Queries Supabase using index `idx_posts_poll` for posts where `scheduled_at <= NOW()` and `status = 'pending'`.\n3. **Atomic Claiming:** Transitions status to `processing` (`UPDATE posts SET status = 'processing' WHERE id = $1 AND status = 'pending'`).\n4. For each claimed post, decrypts the user's LinkedIn access token using server-side AES-256 key.\n5. Publishes post to LinkedIn REST API (`POST https://api.linkedin.com/rest/posts`).\n6. Updates Supabase row status to `published` (or `failed` with error message in `error_log`).\n\n**Sample Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"processed\": 3,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"c89b21f0-uuid\",\n      \"status\": \"published\",\n      \"linkedinPostUrn\": \"urn:li:share:7234567890\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4.2 Instant Publish Single Post",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/posts/{{post_id}}/publish-now",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "posts",
                "{{post_id}}",
                "publish-now"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 4.2 Instant Publish\n\nAllows the user to immediately publish an existing scheduled post or draft without waiting for the cron schedule."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4.3 Get Next Schedule Cadence Window",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Timezone-Offset",
                "value": "180",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "Minutes offset from UTC (e.g. 180 for GMT+3)"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/publish/schedule-window",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "publish",
                "schedule-window"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Calculates the next 10-minute cadence dispatch window synchronized with Cloudflare Worker triggers. Cached in Redis for 30 seconds."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 Success (Redis Cache Hit)",
